	quest.0665899A8F3183EE.quest_desc: [
		"An artificial crystal made from &b&nCertus Quartz&r with excellent energy-conducting properties. It is mainly used to craft machines and items from the &d&nApplied Energistics&r mod, and will be needed in large amounts in later stages."
		""
		"To make it, throw &b&nCertus Quartz&r, &7&nNether Quartz&r and &c&nRedstone&r into water."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:item/fluix_coil width:16 height:16 align:center}"
		""
		"Most machines from the &d&nApplied Energistics&r mod are crafted with &5&nFluix Coils&r, which can be made through &6Sequential Assembly&r."
	]
