	quest.0D3FF0DA73505800.quest_desc: [
		"The &6&nAtmospheric Collector&r collects air from the &ndimension it is placed in&r, without consuming any &e power&r or &2stress&r."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:block/generated/cold_air_still width:16 height:16 align:center}"
		""
		"Every kind of air can be distilled in a &a&nDistillation Tower&r to extract resources from it, but due to stability limits only &b&nOverworld Air&r can be used to make &2&nEnvironmental Gas&r; the other two kinds can only be used for resource extraction."
	]
