	quest.1E67C1D632EC405F.quest_desc: [
		"&b&nShafts&r transmit &e stress&r along their &naxis&r, and are also used to craft many items and machines from &6Create&r."
		""
		"Right-click a &b&nShaft&r while holding &3&nvarious Casings&r to convert it into a &9&nEncased Shaft&r of the matching material (the casing is not consumed). Sneak and right-click with a &e&nWrench&r to remove the casing from a &b&nShaft&r."
		""
		"As you can see, almost every &6Create&r device in this modpack can be &2crafted from various materials&r. If you cannot find the wood type you want to use, search for it with the &aNature's Compass&r."
		""
		"Note that &e&nBelts&r can only be attached to &b&nShafts&r made of &7&nAndesite Alloy&r, but &b&nShafts&r of every material &2are fully functional&r."
	]
