	quest.2B2D6B4837283777.quest_desc: [
		"&2Copper Pipes&r and &9Pumps&r are not very friendly to future industrialization... With &7&nAluminum&r and &d&nPlastic&r, we can make pipes that better suit industrial needs."
		""
		"&aItem Pipes&r can &ntransport items&r. Without upgrades they extract &l4&r items every &l1&r second, with no speed limit for anything other than extraction. These pipes interact normally with Create's &8&nBelts&r, the &e&nInput/Output Buses&r of multiblock machines, and all kinds of containers."
		""
		"&bFluid Pipes&r can &ntransport fluids&r. Without upgrades they extract &l50&r mB of fluid every &l1&r tick, with no speed limit for anything other than extraction. Like &aItem Pipes&r, they also interact normally with other fluid pipes and containers."
		""
		"&cEnergy Pipes&r can &ntransmit power&r. Without upgrades they transfer &l256&r FE every &l1&r tick, with no speed limit for anything other than extraction. These pipes are an excellent replacement for connectors and cables."
		""
		"&dUniversal Pipes&r combine all of the above. Every type of pipe can use &e&nPipe Upgrades&r to &7increase its speed&r or &4unlock redstone control&r."
		""
		"These pipes are not mandatory — every other logistics method also works — but making them makes the experience much easier."
	]
