	quest.3B84B15DD34F155F.quest_desc: [
		"The energy storage of &eBatteries&r may slowly become insufficient at this stage; with &9Supercapacitors&r you can build much larger energy storage."
		""
		"The &bCrystal Energy Storage&r allows all kinds of &nCrystal Blocks&r to be placed in the &l3x3&r area at the center of the structure (mixing them is allowed). Each &nCrystal Block&r adds to the machine's &6maximum capacity&r, and the total maximum capacity is the sum of all &nCrystal Blocks&r."
		""
		"{image:ae2:item/certus_quartz_crystal width:16 height:16 align:center}"
		""
		"&bCertus Quartz&f: &e10⁶ FE &f/ block"
		""
		"{image:ae2:item/fluix_crystal width:16 height:16 align:center}"
		""
		"&dFluix&f: &e10⁷ FE&f/ block"
		""
		"{image:neoecoae:item/energized_crystal width:16 height:16 align:center}"
		""
		"&9Energized Crystal&f: &e10⁸ FE&f/ block"
		""
		"{image:neoecoae:item/energized_fluix_crystal width:16 height:16 align:center}"
		""
		"&5Energized Fluix&f: &e10⁹ FE&f/ block"
		""
		"{image:neoecoae:item/energized_superconductive_ingot width:16 height:16 align:center}"
		""
		"&aEnergized Superconductor&f: &e10¹⁰ FE&f/ block"
	]
