	quest.4665B19516854D27.quest_desc: [
		"The &6&nHose Pulley&r can extract or discharge fluids. The position of the hose pulled down below determines the &2height at which liquids are interacted with&r, and fluids must be actively pumped in or out."
		""
		"When the fluid a &6&nHose Pulley&r draws from exceeds &e500 blocks&r, some fluids are treated as infinite (water needs only 4 blocks). The infinite fluids currently available in this modpack are &cLava&r and &8Crude Oil&r."
	]
