	quest.696D2AA8F7B26D83.quest_desc: [
		"Compared with the Overworld's &7&nCobblestone&r, &4&nNetherrack&r is so soft that it can be ground into powder..."
		""
		"This broadly-defined stone powder can be used to make &e&nGlowstone&r, &c&nRedstone&r or &8&nGunpowder&r, or even made into cake batter like flour. &dBlazes&r might be happy to eat some of this unusual cake."
	]
