	quest.79929F5C3EEA3C4B.quest_desc: [
		"&a&nCogwheels&r transmit &e stress&r between shafts. &a&nSmall Cogwheels&r can transmit &9horizontally&r and &9vertically&r, and together with &a&nLarge Cogwheels&r they can also transmit &ddiagonally&r."
		""
		"Right-click a &a&nCogwheel&r while holding &3&nvarious Casings&r to convert it into a &2&nEncased Cogwheel&r of the matching material (the casing is not consumed). Sneak and right-click with a &e&nWrench&r to remove the casing from a &a&nCogwheel&r."
		""
		"As you can see, almost every &6Create&r device in this modpack can be &2crafted from various materials&r. If you cannot find the wood type you want to use, search for it with the &aNature's Compass&r."
	]
